        <mxCell id="cTAOk4yeP9FnPeryfewb-335" value="&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: center; text-align: center; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15.7px;&quot;&gt;Do a foreach loop on the stateData array. For each item, publish to MQTT - details below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15.7px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;Topic:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.7px;&quot;&gt;&#xa;&quot;state_topic&quot; as calculated before e.g. &quot;inception/lock/{id}&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15.7px;&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15.7px;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Message:&#xa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15.7px;&quot;&gt;the message should be calculated by converting result.stateData.PublicState from the response to binary and pad with zeros to get to 12 digits e.g. 0000 0000 0001.&#xa;Refering to the far left digit as the first digit and the far right as the 12th digit:&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.3px;color:#a31515;&quot;&gt;if the 12th digit=1 then &#39;UNLOCKED&#39;&#xa;if the 4th digit=1 then &#39;LOCKED&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.3px;&quot;&gt;&#xa;else ignore it and don&#39;t update MQTT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;overflow=block;blockSpacing=1;whiteSpace=wrap;shadow=1;fontSize=13;spacing=3.8;strokeColor=none;fillOpacity=100;fillColor=#ffeca9;strokeWidth=0;lucidId=9eZLbGcFPuap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
